      "created_at": "2015-01-12T04:23:08.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The goal of this puzzle is simple. &nbsp;Destroy as many targets as possible in 1 turn. &nbsp;You may choose any legal setup, but you get to stack every deck the way you choose. &nbsp;<span class=\"bbcode-s\">(I recommend that you avoid shuffle effects, however</span> I'm no longer sure that the max is possible without reshuffling, so stacking the deck when you reshuffle is now allowed).</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I haven't actually solved this, but if I've done the math right then I know the max possible, and I think that it's achievable. &nbsp;EDIT: actually, I misread a card. &nbsp;I'm no longer sure that the max is achievable, but you can still get pretty close. EDIT II: Now I think that it's achievable after all.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>All answers and hints should be labeled as such, and then hidden as white text. &nbsp;They should not be quoted, as that will reveal them.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:43:19.179Z",
